#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:4
msgid "椭圆显示"
msgstr "Elliptical display"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:9
msgid "椭圆显示节点用于在图像中检测到的对象下方绘制椭圆标记，提供比矩形边界框更柔和的可视化效果，类似任务光标的效果。"
msgstr ""
"The Ellipse Display node is used to draw elliptical markers under detected "
"objects in the image, providing a softer visualization than a rectangular "
"bounding box, similar to the effect of a task cursor."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:11
msgid "该节点会根据检测框自动计算椭圆参数，支持多种颜色方案、线条粗细调节和角度范围配置，可用于突出显示目标或创建特殊的视觉效果。"
msgstr ""
"This node automatically calculates ellipse parameters based on the detection"
" frame and supports multiple color schemes, line thickness adjustments, and "
"angle range configurations, which can be used to highlight targets or create"
" special visual effects."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:13
msgid "效果展示："
msgstr "Effect display:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:15
