msgstr "**Palette**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:58
msgid "颜色调色板方案，用于为不同类别分配颜色"
msgstr "Color palette scheme for assigning colors to different categories"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:59
msgid "``DEFAULT``"
msgstr "``DEFAULT``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:60
msgid "**调色板大小**"
msgstr "**Palette size**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:61
msgid "调色板中的颜色数量，适用于使用自定义或Matplotlib调色板时"
msgstr ""
"Number of colors in the palette, applicable when using a custom or "
