#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:62
msgid "``10``"
msgstr "``10``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:63
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:99
msgid "**自定义颜色**"
msgstr "**Custom Color**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:64
msgid "自定义颜色列表，使用HEX格式定义椭圆颜色"
msgstr "Custom color list, use HEX format to define ellipse color"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:65
msgid "``[\"#FF0000\", \"#00FF00\", \"#0000FF\"]``"
msgstr "``[\"#FF0000\", \"#00FF00\", \"#0000FF\"]``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:66
msgid "**颜色坐标轴**"
msgstr "**Color Axis**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:67
msgid "颜色分配的依据，通常基于类别（CLASS）来着色"
msgstr ""
"The basis for color assignment, usually coloring based on category (CLASS)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:68
msgid "``CLASS``"
msgstr "``CLASS``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:69
msgid "**椭圆粗细**"
msgstr "**Ellipse Thickness**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:70
msgid "椭圆线条的粗细（像素）"
msgstr "The thickness of the elliptical line (pixels)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:71
msgid "``2``"
msgstr "``2``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:72
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:117
msgid "**起始角度**"
msgstr "**Start angle**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:73
msgid "椭圆弧的起始角度（以度为单位）"
msgstr "Starting angle of the elliptical arc in degrees"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:74
msgid "``45``"
msgstr "``45``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:75
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:128
msgid "**结束角度**"
msgstr "**End angle**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:76
msgid "椭圆弧的结束角度（以度为单位）"
msgstr "The ending angle of the elliptical arc in degrees"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:77
msgid "``235``"
msgstr "``235``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:80
msgid "参数详细说明"
msgstr "Detailed description of parameters"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:84
msgid "**True**：创建图像副本，原始图像保持不变，可用于后续其他可视化操作"
msgstr ""
"**True**: Create a copy of the image, the original image remains unchanged "
"and can be used for other subsequent visualization operations"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:85
msgid "**False**：直接在原图上绘制，节省内存但会修改原图"
msgstr ""
"**False**: Draw directly on the original image, saving memory but modifying "
"the original image."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:89
msgid "选择要可视化的检测模型预测输出。从下拉菜单中选择上游检测模型节点的输出结果，节点会根据边界框自动计算对应的椭圆参数。"
msgstr ""
"Select the detection model prediction output to visualize.Select the output "
"result of the upstream detection model node from the drop-down menu, and the"
" node will automatically calculate the corresponding ellipse parameters "
"based on the bounding box."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:93
msgid "支持多种颜色调色板方案："
msgstr "Supports multiple color palette schemes:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:95
msgid "``DEFAULT``：系统默认配色方案"
msgstr "``DEFAULT``: system default color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:96
msgid "``MATPLOTLIB``：使用Matplotlib的颜色方案"
msgstr "``MATPLOTLIB``: Use Matplotlib's color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:97
msgid "``CUSTOM``：使用自定义颜色列表（需配置自定义颜色参数）"
msgstr ""
"``CUSTOM``: Use a custom color list (custom color parameters need to be "
"configured)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:101
msgid "当调色板选择 ``CUSTOM`` 时，使用HEX格式定义颜色列表："
msgstr ""
"When ``CUSTOM`` is selected for the palette, use HEX format to define the "
"color list:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:107
msgid "分别对应红色、绿色、蓝色、黄色、紫色，颜色会按顺序分配给不同的类别。"
msgstr ""
"Corresponding to red, green, blue, yellow, and purple, the colors will be "
"assigned to different categories in order."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:109
msgid "**颜色坐标轴(在CUSTOM模式下会被忽略)**"
msgstr "**Color axis (ignored in CUSTOM mode)**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:111
msgid "决定如何为椭圆标记分配颜色："
msgstr "Decide how to assign colors to elliptical markers:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:113
msgid "``CLASS``：根据物体类别着色，同类物体使用相同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``CLASS``: Color according to object category, similar objects use the same "
"color"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:114
msgid "``INDEX``：为每个物体分配不同颜色"
msgstr "``INDEX``: assign a different color to each object"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:115
msgid "``TRACK``：根据Tracker ID着色，每个Tracker ID使用不同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``TRACK``: Colored according to Tracker ID, use different colors for each "
"Tracker ID"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:119
msgid "设置椭圆弧的起始角度，单位为度（-180-180°）。默认值为 ``-45``。"
msgstr ""
"Set the starting angle of the elliptical arc in degrees (-180-180°).The "
"default value is ``-45``."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:121
msgid "``0``：从正右方开始"
msgstr "``0``: Start from the right"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:122
msgid "``-45``：从右上方开始（默认）"
msgstr "``-45``: Start from top right (default)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:123
msgid "``90``：从正下方开始"
msgstr "``90``: Start directly below"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:124
msgid "``180/-180``：从正左方开始"
msgstr "``180/-180``: Start from the direct left"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:126
msgid "角度按顺时针方向计算。"
msgstr "Angle is calculated in clockwise direction."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:130
msgid "设置椭圆弧的结束角度，单位为度（-180-180°）。默认值为 ``235``。"
msgstr ""
"Set the end angle of the elliptical arc in degrees (-180-180°).The default "
"value is ``235``."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:132
msgid "如果 ``起始角度 = -180`` 且 ``结束角度 = 180``：绘制完整椭圆"
msgstr ""
"If ``start angle = -180`` and ``end angle = 180``: draw the complete ellipse"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:133
msgid "如果 ``起始角度 = -45`` 且 ``结束角度 = 235``：绘制大部分椭圆弧（默认配置）"
msgstr ""
"If ``start angle = -45`` and ``end angle = 235``: draw most elliptical arcs "
"(default configuration)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/ellipse_display.rst:135
msgid "通过调整起始角度和结束角度，可以绘制完整椭圆或特定角度范围的椭圆弧，创建不同的视觉效果。"
msgstr ""
"By adjusting the start angle and end angle, you can draw a complete ellipse "
"or an elliptical arc with a specific angle range to create different visual "
"effects."
